---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---
<Section eyebrow="Why Codevil">
  <div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Self-hosted by default</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-fg-3">
        Deploys to your own Cloudflare account. No tenant rows, no proxy billing, no data
        leaving your infrastructure. The Cloudflare account is the trust boundary.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Bring your own keys</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-fg-3">
        Use your own LLM provider keys — Anthropic, OpenAI, or any of the 15+ providers Pi
        supports. Your spend, your rate limits, your cost controls.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Readable & hackable</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-fg-3">
        Built on the Pi SDK — a minimal, extensible coding agent you can read end-to-end.
        Four core tools. Model-agnostic. Made to be understood and extended.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
